       "w": "3/5",
       "items": [
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>In Celebration of the City of San Carlos' Centennial year, the SCPR have put out historical markers all throughout San Carlos. Have you had a chance to see any of the 23 spots? All locations can be spotted from the yellow sticker on the ground. Scan the QR code and learn a little bit more about all of the locations in San Carlos. Read the guide below.</p>"
        },
        {
