            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008080;\">ABOUT AGENTS OF DISCOVERY</span></h4>",
             "look": {
              "h4": {
               "s": 28
              },
              "h5": {
               "s": 21
              }
             }
            },
            {
             "t": "text",
             "html": "<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">A Year-Long Augmented Reality Challenge</h4>\n<p>Agents of Discovery is a fun, interactive app that brings the city’s history, parks, and community to life through augmented reality. Created by the San Carlos Youth Advisory Council, this year-long game features <strong>12 unique missions</strong> released every first day of the month, each set in a different park or local destination.</p>\n<p>Players can test their knowledge of San Carlos history, explore their surroundings, and solve custom challenges curated by local organizations. Unlock both <strong>digital and real-world rewards</strong>. Download Agents of Discovery on the App Store or Google Play and start exploring San Carlos in a whole new way.</p>",
             "look": {
              "h4": {
               "s": 28
              }
             }
            },
            {
             "t": "button",
             "text": "Download in Apple Store",
             "href": "https://www.bystadium.com/us/en/stores/city-of-san-carlos-centennial-83380/S312168806"
            },
